<span id="S4.F5.3.2.2.1.2" class="ltx_p"><em id="S4.F5.3.2.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:50%;">style of Picasso’</em></span>
</span></th>
<th id="S4.F5.3.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:1.0pt;padding-right:1.0pt;">
<span id="S4.F5.3.2.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block">
<span id="S4.F5.3.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><em id="S4.F5.3.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:50%;">’An image of an animal</em><span id="S4.F5.3.2.3.1.1.2" class="ltx_text"></span></span>
<span id="S4.F5.3.2.3.1.2" class="ltx_p"><em id="S4.F5.3.2.3.1.2.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:50%;">half mouse half octopus’</em></span>
</span></th>
<th id="S4.F5.3.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:1.0pt;padding-right:1.0pt;">
<span id="S4.F5.3.2.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block">
<span id="S4.F5.3.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_p"><em id="S4.F5.3.2.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:50%;">’An illustration of a slightly</em><span id="S4.F5.3.2.4.1.1.2" class="ltx_text"></span></span>
<span id="S4.F5.3.2.4.1.2" class="ltx_p"><em id="S4.F5.3.2.4.1.2.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:50%;">conscious neural network’</em></span>
</span></th>
<th id="S4.F5.3.2.5" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:1.0pt;padding-right:1.0pt;">
<span id="S4.F5.3.2.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block">
<span id="S4.F5.3.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_p"><em id="S4.F5.3.2.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:50%;">’A painting of a</em><span id="S4.F5.3.2.5.1.1.2" class="ltx_text"></span></span>
<span id="S4.F5.3.2.5.1.2" class="ltx_p"><em id="S4.F5.3.2.5.1.2.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:50%;">squirrel eating a burger’</em></span>
</span></th>
<th id="S4.F5.3.2.6" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:1.0pt;padding-right:1.0pt;">
<span id="S4.F5.3.2.6.1" class="ltx_inline-block">
<span id="S4.F5.3.2.6.1.1" class="ltx_p"><em id="S4.F5.3.2.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:50%;">’A watercolor painting of a</em><span id="S4.F5.3.2.6.1.1.2" class="ltx_text"></span></span>
<span id="S4.F5.3.2.6.1.2" class="ltx_p"><em id="S4.F5.3.2.6.1.2.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:50%;">chair that looks like an octopus’</em></span>
</span></th>
<th id="S4.F5.3.2.7" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:1.0pt;padding-right:1.0pt;">
<span id="S4.F5.3.2.7.1" class="ltx_inline-block">
<span id="S4.F5.3.2.7.1.1" class="ltx_p"><em id="S4.F5.3.2.7.1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:50%;">’A shirt with the inscription:</em></span>
<span id="S4.F5.3.2.7.1.2" class="ltx_p"><em id="S4.F5.3.2.7.1.2.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:50%;">“I love generative models!” ’</em></span>
</span></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="S4.F5.3.3" class="ltx_tr">
