<em id="S4.F10.6.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">LDM-SR</em> has advantages at rendering realistic textures but
SR3 can synthesize more coherent fine structures.
See appendix for additional samples and cropouts. SR3 results from <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib72" title="" class="ltx_ref">DBLP:journals/corr/abs-2104-07636</a></cite>.
</span></figcaption>
</figure>
