<span id="S4.T6.p1.1.1.1.1.1.1.6.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_bb">0.36</span>
<span id="S4.T6.p1.1.1.1.1.1.1.6.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">6.66</span>
<span id="S4.T6.p1.1.1.1.1.1.1.6.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">15.95</span></span>
</span>
</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></p>
</div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_block"><span id="S4.T6.3.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 6</span>: </span><span id="S4.T6.3.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
Assessing inpainting efficiency. <sup id="S4.T6.3.5.1" class="ltx_sup"><span id="S4.T6.3.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">†</span></sup>: Deviations from Fig. <a href="#S4.F7" title="Figure 7 ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ High-Resolution Image Synthesis with Latent Diffusion Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a> due to varying GPU settings/batch sizes <em id="S4.T6.3.5.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">cf</em>.<span id="S4.T6.3.5.3" class="ltx_text"></span> the supplement.</span></figcaption>
</div>
</figure>
