<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A4.F19.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 19</span>: </span><span id="A4.F19.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
<em id="A4.F19.6.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">LDM-BSR</em> generalizes to arbitrary inputs and can be used as a general-purpose upsampler,
upscaling samples from the LSUN-Cows dataset to <math id="A4.F19.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1024^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mn>1024</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1024^{2}</annotation></semantics></math> resolution.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
