<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix E </span>Implementation Details and Hyperparameters</h2>

<section id="A5.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.1 </span>Hyperparameters</h3>

<div id="A5.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We provide an overview of the hyperparameters of all trained <em id="A5.SS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">LDM</em> models in Tab. <a href="#A5.T12" title="Table 12 ‣ E.1 Hyperparameters ‣ Appendix E Implementation Details and Hyperparameters ‣ High-Resolution Image Synthesis with Latent Diffusion Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a>, Tab. <a href="#A5.T13" title="Table 13 ‣ E.1 Hyperparameters ‣ Appendix E Implementation Details and Hyperparameters ‣ High-Resolution Image Synthesis with Latent Diffusion Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a>, Tab. <a href="#A5.T14" title="Table 14 ‣ E.1 Hyperparameters ‣ Appendix E Implementation Details and Hyperparameters ‣ High-Resolution Image Synthesis with Latent Diffusion Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">14</span></a> and Tab. <a href="#A5.T15" title="Table 15 ‣ E.1 Hyperparameters ‣ Appendix E Implementation Details and Hyperparameters ‣ High-Resolution Image Synthesis with Latent Diffusion Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">15</span></a>.</p>
</div>
