<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A5.T14.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 14</span>: </span><span id="A5.T14.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> Hyperparameters for the unconditional <em id="A5.T14.7.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">LDMs</em> trained on the CelebA dataset for the analysis in Fig. <a href="#S4.F7" title="Figure 7 ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ High-Resolution Image Synthesis with Latent Diffusion Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>. All models trained on a single NVIDIA A100. <sup id="A5.T14.7.2" class="ltx_sup">∗</sup>: All models are trained for 500k iterations. If converging earlier, we used the best checkpoint for assessing the provided FID scores.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
